procode,source,portfolio_type,display_name,base_currency,status
# One row per (procode, source). FMS own accounts: source=fms,
# portfolio_type=own_account, status=backfill-pending (the forwards run
# flips them to active on first successful load). procode must match the
# CodigoFondo emitted by FMS. Copy this file to portfolios.csv and fill in
# the real fund codes (the 4-vs-12 account-count question is settled here,
# by the set you register). portfolios.csv is git-ignored.
